# otel — tracing

This product wires `otel.Module()` + `otel.TraceRoutes` (a server span per route,
joining the caller's W3C traceparent).

- `[otel]` section: service_name, exporter (otlp|stdout|none), sample_ratio
  (HOT-RELOADABLE — raise a misbehaving box to 1.0 at runtime). Exporter honors
  `OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_*` envs; `exporter=none` until configured.
- Extend the waterfall, one registration each: `otel.TracePG` (span per query),
  `otel.TraceRedis`, `otel.TraceLogs` (slog lines gain trace_id/span_id),
  `otel.TraceClient` (outbound *http.Client carries traceparent),
  `otel.TraceInference` (client span per gRPC RPC).

